@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<h1>About this demo</h1>

<p>
    This app renders two charts generated by RegiaBI through its MCP server
    (<code>@@bicharts/chart-mcp</code>) from <code>state_store_sales.csv</code>: a choropleth map of the
    50 US states plus DC shaded by revenue, and a bubble chart plotting revenue against return rate.
    The charts are generated files committed to the app, run by the open-source
    <code>@@bicharts/chart-host</code>. Nothing is fetched from a service or regenerated at run time,
    and no API key is needed.
</p>
<p>
    Clicking a state on the map or a bubble on the chart cross-filters the other. Ctrl-click
    (Cmd-click on a Mac) extends the selection, and the Clear button on the charts page resets
    both.
</p>

